OL,3,GNEWSABurglars steal rings and throw
OL,4,Apaint over pet dog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man returned home from an evening out
OL,7,Fto find his home had been broken into
OL,8,Fand the intruders had stolen valuables
OL,9,Fand thrown paint over his dog.
OL,11,FSteven Paddock and his family left
OL,12,Ftheir home in Stratton,
OL,13,FGloucestershire, on Monday evening and
OL,14,Freturned hours later to find their
OL,15,Fpatio doors smashed and valuables,
OL,16,Fincluding his wife's engagement and
OL,17,Fwedding rings, had been taken.
OL,19,FPaddock said the family's springer
OL,20,Fspaniel, Chip, had been abused by the
OL,21,Fburglars and "spent that night spooning
OL,22,Fwith me and trembling".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
